From 95444c86b3b066311810d83be99f82069db32039 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: homar <homar@local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:24:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] homar app icon: Homa Lawn's sunset phone, with a monochrome
 layer for themed icons

ic_launcher_home (the icon the manifest uses for every build) becomes an
adaptive icon that looks like Homa Lawn's picture: the picture fills the
middle 72 dp of the 108 dp canvas; the background layer is its sunset
scene (sky, sun, hill) with the phone taken out, its edges stretched to
the canvas's edge; the foreground is the phone where the picture has it,
all of it inside the 66 dp safe circle; the monochrome layer is the
phone's outline and app square in white (replaces Lawnchair's vector).
Legacy square and round PNGs at every density are the whole picture. All
bitmaps are made by assets/make_icons.py in the Homa Lawn repo.
